<title>POLAND: PROCHEM JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 407,900.</title>
<headline>PROCHEM JUNE NET FALLS TO PLN 407,900.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.41 vs   0.41</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.71 vs   0.66</p>
